# Work machine casks
#
# Intentionally empty. The work host's extras now come from the company's own
# MDM catalog (munki `GustoManagedManifest`) rather than Homebrew, and the
# three casks that used to collide with it -- 1password, microsoft-office and
# notion -- live in Brewfile.personal / Brewfile.alt instead.
#
# The personal App Store apps live there too, by preference rather than by any
# limit here: `mas` works on this host and the shared Brewfile carries the
# work-relevant entries.
#
# Keep this file even while empty: roles/osx/tasks/homebrew.yml runs
# `brew bundle install --file=Brewfile.{{ inventory_hostname }}` unconditionally,
# so deleting it fails the play rather than skipping the step.
